<item>
            <title>[IGNITE-1127] Query with result size more then one page doesn&apos;t increase Query executions count metric </title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-1127</link>
                <project id="12315922" key="IGNITE">Ignite</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;Queries for partitioned caches and limited page size doesn&apos;t increase executions count metric in case if not all records was actually fetched by client code.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
                <environment></environment>
        <key id="12845471">IGNITE-1127</key>
            <summary>Query with result size more then one page doesn&apos;t increase Query executions count metric </summary>
